ck  gilifinakis or patton oswalt someone  like that i don't know now he says that  and it's obviously just a joke i don't  think he really wants zach ilifinakis or  patton oswald to play wolverine no  offense to them but rhett reese does go  on to say some pretty good information  he says look we don't have any inside  information on that even if we did we  couldn't share it but we don't i would  honestly go more an undiscovered person  because hugh jackman was reasonably  undiscovered the first time and i think  there was an initial buck off oh he's  too tall or he doesn't look right or  what is this australian thing i think  that if they're playing their cards  right they probably should make it  someone we've never seen and that's a  pretty interesting suggestion i like  that idea because it's true when hugh  jackman became wolverine he wasn't that  well known at the time he's done some  amazing movies throughout his career but  the x-men movies were pretty big i mean  he is wolverine he is known for being  wolverine and the other writer for  deadpool 3 paul warnock stepped in and  said oh don't worry they'll play their  cards right you know kevin feige he  knows what he's doing over there he  doesn't need any of our opinions now i  love this because keep in mind kevin  feige was working with marvel and worked  on the x-men films that's how he got  started with marvel and there have been  a lot of fan castings for wolverine  lately and a lot of them are really  really good not patton oswalt good but  pretty dang good but i agree with the  writers i think wolverine needs to be  shorter in the comics he is five foot  three he is very short and he's 300  pounds but keep in mind most of that  weight is from the adamantium even  though wolverine is always pretty dang  jacked and that's one of the main  complaints of hugh jackman's wolverine  is he is way too tall to be wolverine  now don't get me wrong i love him as  wolverine he did an amazing job and  whoever the new wolverine is going to be  has some serious big shoes to fill but  since we're essentially rebooting let's  get somebody that is more comic accurate  somebody that deadpool could definitely  make fun of for being short and not  being who jackman because you know he's  gonna crack that joke but let me know  your thoughts on this i thought this was  really cool to hear from the deadpool 3  writers hopefully they put some jokes in  there but who would you like to see play  wolverine let me know your thoughts in  the comments down below and don't forget  to like the video and subscribe so you  can stay up to date on all of the latest  marvel news you can also follow me on  twitter and instagram for live updates  and as always thank you all so much for  watching woof
 

